WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.280
 Hi there, I'm Carlo Doroff, born and raised in Minnesota,

00:00:06.280 --> 00:00:07.640
 but a junior at the University

00:00:07.640 --> 00:00:12.680
 of Miami, where I'm studying finance, entrepreneurship, and AI.

00:00:12.680 --> 00:00:15.380
 I have experience ranging from sales, finance, and

00:00:15.380 --> 00:00:17.560
 investment banking wealth management,

00:00:17.560 --> 00:00:19.760
 and also starting my own company.

00:00:19.760 --> 00:00:23.990
 In sales, I've done door-to-door sales, where I generated $107,000,

00:00:23.990 --> 00:00:25.280
 selling door-to-door

00:00:25.280 --> 00:00:27.400
 in Winchester, Massachusetts.

00:00:27.400 --> 00:00:31.080
 Pest control. Following that job, I went into investment

00:00:31.080 --> 00:00:32.600
 banking, where I worked at

00:00:32.600 --> 00:00:34.840
 Curvature Securities.

00:00:34.840 --> 00:00:36.800
 We worked on micro-cap deals.

00:00:36.800 --> 00:00:40.530
 After that, I started my own company, Craze, where we did

00:00:40.530 --> 00:00:42.520
 Gen Z market research for companies

00:00:42.520 --> 00:00:45.960
 like Celsius and Victoria's Secret subsidiaries.

00:00:45.960 --> 00:00:49.200
 We had a student app across 198 campuses.

00:00:49.200 --> 00:00:53.040
 And now, I'm leading go-to-market at a startup in San Francisco.

00:00:53.040 --> 00:00:56.210
 If you're interested in tech, entrepreneurship, or would

00:00:56.210 --> 00:00:58.080
 like to connect about anything at

00:00:58.080 --> 00:00:59.680
 all, reach out.

00:00:59.680 --> 00:01:00.520
 Thank you so much.

